{"id":"n29758-1-7","stage":1,"title":"찾아보다 · 去找","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29758-1-7-1","ko":"졸업한 친구들은 다들 어떻게 사는지 궁금하네.","zh":"真好奇那些已经毕业的朋友们现在都过得怎么样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"졸업한","meaning":"毕业","explanation":"졸업하다：毕业；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"졸업하다","audio":"/audio/c84e33bf996dc40d6b1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91755","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸업하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸업한","audio":"/audio/7dd2a3fb433622799c70.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들은","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들은","audio":"/audio/3bdca9585776fd3c83fb.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"사는지","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는지","audio":"/audio/02b15c686bafd9f0f2f4.mp3"}},{"text":"궁금하네.","meaning":"好奇，纳闷儿","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，纳闷儿；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"궁금하네","audio":"/audio/da0c7f1ff4ffb65c96d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c84e33bf996dc40d","term":"졸업하다","zh":"毕业","audio":"/audio/c84e33bf996dc40d6b1f.mp3","entryId":"91755","definition":"学生修完学校规定的全部课程。","pronunciation":["조러파다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，纳闷儿","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"非常想知道。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c5f5a804689ef3cc46b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29758-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 이제 친구들을 좀 찾아봐야겠어.","zh":"是啊，是时候去联系一下那些朋友了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들을","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들을","audio":"/audio/c6e57580704d18a02a8d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아봐야겠어.","meaning":"去找，去见，拜访，走访","explanation":"찾아보다：去找，去见，拜访，走访；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아봐야겠어","audio":"/audio/3c495616a0dbf1557fb3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"去找，去见，拜访，走访","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"到某人所在的地方去见他。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef1b53829c05c24eb726.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":